    narr:narration """This hub tracks the [foundational positioning](narr:Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform) of the product as a structured alternative to real-time chat, explicitly framing tools like Slack as [anti-patterns](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat). Established in March 2026, this strategy targets [remote teams of 10-50](narr:Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams) experiencing decision-loss. The economic model began with [base pricing of $12/user](narr:Position_PricingTwelveDollars), though internal reviews in late March 2026 introduced a tiered adjustment for larger teams. By August 2026, the narrative shifted from abstract positioning to [demonstrable execution](narr:Position_ShippedWidgetVelocityAchievement), evidenced by the [shipment of an async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786355730113_1) and a [peak velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786355730113_2), signaling a transition from vision-setting to operational validation.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786355730113_1> ;
